      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تظبّى</span></b> , if used, means <i>He acted like the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَبْى</span>, or <i>gazelle;</i> being similar to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَذَأَّبَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَمَّرَ</span>
&amp;c.: its part. n. is mentioned in the first paragraph of art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ربض</span>.]

